{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/extras/56a211070de03f2f7f1ff7fe0d69fc25.poster.avif?t=1772605809\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/extras/56a211070de03f2f7f1ff7fe0d69fc25.webm?t=1772605809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/extras/56a211070de03f2f7f1ff7fe0d69fc25.mp4?t=1772605809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The era of sky pirates has begun! Captain your own airship in search of the ultimate treasure. To do that, you'll need to build a deck of unit, device skill cards. Engage in tactical turn based combat as you defend your airship from raiders and enemy sky pirates in a steampunk world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/extras/2ded58ba870f42125644e3d68ed4d3ba.avif?t=1772605809\" width=582 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/extras/229e2a1bff2aace93743b3f18236181f.poster.avif?t=1772605809\" width=1170 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/extras/229e2a1bff2aace93743b3f18236181f.webm?t=1772605809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/extras/229e2a1bff2aace93743b3f18236181f.mp4?t=1772605809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a combination of unit, device and skill cards to plan your move and develop your strategy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/extras/27cec8f70097a026e9585ceafc022337.avif?t=1772605809\" width=582 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/extras/8d0f98b8b8c932f62c0779e42672de27.poster.avif?t=1772605809\" width=1170 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/extras/8d0f98b8b8c932f62c0779e42672de27.webm?t=1772605809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/extras/8d0f98b8b8c932f62c0779e42672de27.mp4?t=1772605809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deck, your choice. Craft your deck with your favourite strategies. Enlist the aid of different guilds, each with their own strengths and weaknesses. From the valiant Adventurer's guild, resourceful Cannoneer's guild to the crafty Inventor's guild, it's up to you to mix and match them to create your perfect strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/extras/8d1e47c373ee23bcf225ecca6b4608df.avif?t=1772605809\" width=582 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/extras/63e2536293942d66fe268db30487e6ff.poster.avif?t=1772605809\" width=1170 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/extras/63e2536293942d66fe268db30487e6ff.webm?t=1772605809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/extras/63e2536293942d66fe268db30487e6ff.mp4?t=1772605809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you'll need all the help you can get. Choose islands to visit before each combat. Every island presents an opportunity to scout for new crew members, repair and upgrade your ship and encounter random events. Making the correct choice could mean the difference between life and death.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984940?t=1772605809","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984940?t=1772605809","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/177e85319c8568164f87932c806589bb15701bb7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772605809","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/177e85319c8568164f87932c806589bb15701bb7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772605809","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/extras/56a211070de03f2f7f1ff7fe0d69fc25.poster.avif?t=1772605809\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984940/extras/56a211070de03f2f7f1ff7fe0d69fc25.webm?t=1772605809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai